# Installed Agent Skills are not committed: skills-lock.json is the source of truth
# for which external skills are used and at which commit. Skills authored in this
# repository are un-ignored below. .claude/skills/ holds the CLI's links to them.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/verified-research-report/
.claude/skills/
